    <entry>
      <name>Report Export Transformation Error Log</name>
      <description/>
      <type>WRITE_TO_LOG</type>
      <attributes/>
      <logmessage>================================================================================
[CRITICAL ERROR] Execution Failed: Report Export Transformation
Timestamp: ${Internal.Job.Execution.Date}
Job: ${Internal.Job.Name}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Problem Description:
An error occurred during data aggregation or workbook generation while exporting 
daily production and anomaly reports to Excel (.xlsx).

Probable Root Causes:
1. Destination directory missing or write permission denied:
   - Target path: data/reports/
2. Target file locked by another process (e.g., file open in Microsoft Excel).
3. Failed query execution or connection timeout to PostgreSQL (NeonDB).
4. Java Heap Space / OutOfMemory exception during large sheet generation.

System Action:
Job execution aborted immediately to prevent sending empty, corrupted, 
or incomplete report attachments via email.
Inspect the detailed stack trace below for root cause analysis.
================================================================================</logmessage>
      <loglevel>Error</loglevel>
      <logsubject>[CLAYSENSE ETL ERROR] - Excel Report Generation Failed</logsubject>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <draw>Y</draw>
      <nr>0</nr>
      <xloc>528</xloc>
      <yloc>352</yloc>
      <attributes_kjc/>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <name>Anomaly Report Email Sending Error Log</name>
      <description/>
      <type>WRITE_TO_LOG</type>
      <attributes/>
      <logmessage>================================================================================
[CRITICAL ALERT] Execution Failed: General Report + Anomaly Warning (Email Dispatch)
Timestamp: ${Internal.Job.Execution.Date}
Job: ${Internal.Job.Name}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Problem Description:
The ETL job detected kiln operational anomalies or high piece rejection rates, 
but failed to dispatch the urgent notification email with report attachments.

Probable Root Causes:
1. SMTP server connectivity timeout or authentication failure (bad credentials / app password).
2. Attachment files missing or inaccessible:
   - Expected paths: daily production report and anomaly report in data/reports/
3. Recipient email address syntax error or relay rejected by destination host.
4. Total attachment size exceeded mail server payload limits.

System Action:
Notification sequence halted and flagged as failed.
Supervisor alert not delivered via email. Check SMTP server logs and network routes below.
================================================================================</logmessage>
      <loglevel>Error</loglevel>
      <logsubject>[CLAYSENSE ALERT ERROR] - Anomaly Email Dispatch Failed</logsubject>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <draw>Y</draw>
      <nr>0</nr>
      <xloc>896</xloc>
      <yloc>208</yloc>
      <attributes_kjc/>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <name>General Report Email Sending Error Log</name>
      <description/>
      <type>WRITE_TO_LOG</type>
      <attributes/>
      <logmessage>================================================================================
[ERROR] Execution Failed: General Report (Email Dispatch)
Timestamp: ${Internal.Job.Execution.Date}
Job: ${Internal.Job.Name}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Problem Description:
The standard daily production cost report was generated successfully, but the 
scheduled email delivery to management failed to dispatch.

Probable Root Causes:
1. Outbound SMTP connection failure (network drop, timeout, or authentication issue).
2. Report file missing or unreadable in source folder:
   - Expected path: data/reports/production_costs_report*.xlsx
3. Target mail server rejected the message (invalid recipient list or spam policy).
4. Port blockage or TLS/SSL handshake negotiation error.

System Action:
Delivery aborted. Sent status flagged as uncompleted.
Check the stack trace and SMTP connection parameters below.
================================================================================</logmessage>
      <loglevel>Error</loglevel>
      <logsubject>[CLAYSENSE ETL ERROR] - Standard Report Dispatch Failed</logsubject>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <draw>Y</draw>
      <nr>0</nr>
      <xloc>896</xloc>
